<title>FRANCE: CGIP net attrib rises to 1.298 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>CGIP net attrib rises to 1.298 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   1,298  vs	     514</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			 40  vs		37</p>
<p>    Pre-exceptional result		     628  vs	     440</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said in a results statement ahead of a news conference that the various sectors it operates in were &quot;favourably oriented&quot; since the start of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
